{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14231710","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14231710","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423171001:0":{"text":"광산에도 생산 라인에도 하루가 다르게 사람이 늘어나고 있어.","source_cn":"一天比一天多起来啦，矿洞那边也是，生产线这边也是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C5FC0C9A910B561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423171002:1":{"text":"뭐 모아 강철이라는 건 연구해 냈는데, 깊은바위 수정보다 낫다며? 그래서 다들 열심히 일하고 있다니까!","source_cn":"听说研究出了什么魔钢，比深岩晶还好用，大伙正干得热火朝天呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57BEA65D9CDC05CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423171003:1":{"text":"일 끝난 사람들한테 빵이랑 맥주를 먹이려면 나도 좀 더 준비해야겠군.","source_cn":"我得再多准备点，让他们干完活就能吃喝上面包和啤酒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6F866886B2DED64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矮人巴尔姆":{"text":"드워프 바룸","source":"矮人巴尔姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}